[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    242[0m:[38;5;10m[49m range — reported **0 anomalies** outside the 19 ASLR bytes above.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    243[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    244[0m:[38;5;10m[49m The other two emulation layers were checked the same way, against small C
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    245[0m:[38;5;10m[49m programs that call the same libc functions:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    246[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
