[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    249[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   and 2,000,000 random bit patterns) produced byte-identical output.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    250[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `scanf("%d%f%f%f%d%d%d%d%f%f%f%d")`: 4,007 inputs (each tricky token in each
